    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d678">

                <pb facs="0966" n="946" xml:id="pg946"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">746G.00(W)/10–1350: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Hong Kong</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Wilkinson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hong Kong</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1950-10-13T17:00:00+09:00">October 13, 1950—5
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received October 14—10:35 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>787. I. <hi rendition="#italic">Political</hi>.</p>
                <p>Crossing of 38th parallel by American troops brought prompt reaction from Peking
                    in form of renewed warning that Chinese people could not “stand idly by” with
                    regard to “serious situation created by invasion of Korea by US and its
                    accomplice countries in dangerous trend towards extending war”. Although news
                    caused flurry in hypersensitive gold market, it did not seem to alter
                    generally-held Hong Kong opinion that Chinese Communist unlikely become
                    militarily involved.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <p>Department pass Crypto for Army for CINCFE, CINCPAC, COMSEVENTHTASKFLT, CINCFE
                    pass COMNAVFE, pouched AmEmb Taipei, AmLeg Saigon, and American Consulate Hanoi.
                    Joint WEEKA 41 from SANA.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilkinson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
